    "note": "The center tank lines differ: CTR TK PUMP 1 and 2 on HS-TXA..TXO, CTR TK L and R XFR on HS-TXP..TXU."
  },
  "summary": "A fuel imbalance may be a fuel leak, so check the fuel first: compare FOB + FU with the FOB at departure, and do not apply this procedure if a leak is suspected. Otherwise open the crossfeed, stop the center tank feed and switch OFF the pumps on the lighter side. When balanced, restore the pumps and close the crossfeed.",
